  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure><desc>A grand piano, in a ruled frame with ornamental bands above and below</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#in"><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller">(Licensee)</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger">Reproducing Pianos</hi></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#suit_every_mood" type="topic" resp="#claude">The wild rhythm of a mazurka, the lure
          <lb/>of a Venetian love lyric, the poignant
          <lb/>charm of a simple plantation melody</seg>,
          <lb/>assume a new beauty when formed
          <lb/>under the hands of a master.</p>
        <p><lb/><seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#touch_of_a_button" type="topic" resp="#claude">At a touch of a key</seg> the <name type="brand">Heintzman &amp;
          <lb/>Co. Welte-Mignon Reproducing Piano</name>
          <lb/>will shower forth the glorious music of
          <lb/>a <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName> or a <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118641832">Rachmaninoff</persName> or a
          <lb/><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">De Pachmann</persName> — <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude">their actual playing,
          <lb/>their technique, tone color and tempo</seg>.</p>
        <p><lb/>Marvellous! Yes, but <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#affordability" type="topic" resp="#claude">you can easily
          <lb/>have one of these pianos in your home</seg>.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_invitation">
        <ab><hi rendition="#i #smaller"><lb/>Come to our Music Salons and
          <lb/>hear the wonderful <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>
          <lb/>play for you the music of the
          <lb/>masters—or write for descriptive
          <lb/>literature.</hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_signature">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#b #i">Ye Olde Firme</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#in #larger"><orgName>Heintzman &amp; Co.</orgName></hi>
          <lb/><address><addrLine>193-197 YONGE STREET</addrLine>
          <lb/><addrLine>TORONTO</addrLine></address></hi></ab>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
